  "prefLabel": "Den 101.34 Treatment plan",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Den 101.34 “Treatment plan” means a written plan that reflects the particular benefits and risks of opioid use for each individual patient and establishes goals, expectations, methods, and time course for treatment.\n\nSource. #14140, eff 1-31-25",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/den100-500.html"
